<item name='HFText'><text>No</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Placing An Order</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Commander</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>6</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>When the order has been delivered,</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.0118in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Verify that all ordered items were shipped.  If so, mark the packing slip with your initials, the date, and the words "verified complete".</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  If the order is incomplete, mark the packing slip with your initials, the date, and the word "incomplete".</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.0625in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='3'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>N.B.</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>  If the order was incomplete, it is your responsibility to follow-up with the company as to when they will be shipping the balance of the ordered items.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  Send the packing slip to the Admin person.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>À la livraison de la commande :</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.	Vérifiez si elle est complète. Dans ce cas, inscrivez vos initiales, la date et la mention «Complète» sur le bordereau 	de réception.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.	Dans le cas contraire, faites de même mais inscrivez plutôt «Incomplète».</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>N.B.</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> Si la commande est incomplète, il vous incombe d'effectuer le suivi auprès du fournisseur afin de savoir quand 	vous recevrez le reste de la commande.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.	Envoyez le bordereau de réception à l'adjoint administratif.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpESubject'><text>After the Order has Arrived</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubject'><text>Que faire après la réception d'une commande? </text></item></document>

